# Frontend environment template.
# Copy to .env and fill in real values. Never commit the real .env.
#
# Note: Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client bundle at build
# time. Only put values here that are safe for a browser to see. Secrets
# (Mongo URIs, JWT secrets, Cloudinary keys) belong in server/.env only.

# Base URL of the blogs/auth API. No trailing slash.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-host.example.com
